From 12e9452176e8904923be64acfb02bba5564dc880 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Waltteri Hooli <1420194+wahooli@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 19:47:16 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] frame_gen: show real and generated frame rate around a
 frame-generating layer

Add a probe layer (libMangoHud_probe.so) that counts vkQueuePresentKHR on the
other side of a frame generator (lsfg-vk), a meta-layer that pins the order
probe -> lsfg-vk -> overlay, and a frame_gen row that shows the rate the fps
row does not show plus the measured multiplier.
---
